    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1845">

                <pb facs="1212" n="1096" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1096"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 702.04/4.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister McGoodwin.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 90.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 11, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department has received your No. 212
                    of July 14th last with which you enclose with translation a copy of the note
                    from the Venezuelan Minister of Foreign Affairs advising you that the Government
                    of Venezuela has granted unrestricted and permanent permission to all salaried
                    consular officers of the United States to visit ships of whatever nationality
                    bound for ports in the United States. Porto Rico and Colon.</p>
                <pb facs="1213" n="1097" xml:id="pg1097"/>
                <p>The Department desires that you convey to the Venezuelan Foreign Office an
                    expression of its sincere appreciation of the action taken by the Government of
                    Venezuela.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
